00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:58.780
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:04.410
<i>Before the time comes
when there's no turning back</i>

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:07.250
<i>Let's turn things in a positive direction</i>

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:13.830
<i>If you don't take action,
you won't get anywhere</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:18.160
<i>Never gonna stop, never gonna stop</i>

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:20.550
<i>The feeling of love is happiness</i>

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:22.540
