00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:27.000
Next Peacemaker Kurogane

00:23:26.790 --> 00:23:28.950
<i>I swear, kiddies are just...</i>

00:23:28.950 --> 00:23:30.370
<i>Well, you have to train at everything.</i>

00:23:30.370 --> 00:23:33.500
<i>Ooh, speaking of training,
there's the perfect person for it.</i>

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:36.560
